  "prefLabel": "Den 101.20 Licensure by endorsement certification",
  "priorExpiration": "1997-04-04",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Den 101.20 “Licensure by endorsement certification” means granting a license to practice dentistry or to provide dental hygiene services in New Hampshire based upon compliance with the applicable requirements of Den 300, and holding a current, unsuspended, unrestricted license to practice in another state.\n\nSource. #4298, eff 7-28-87; ss by #5110, eff 4-4-91, EXPIRED: 4-4-97\n\nNew. #6908, eff 12-9-98; ss by #12427 (from Den 101.14); renumbered by #14140 (formerly Den 101.17)",
